- Made the Version column sortable (and the default sort) on the dashboard "Operating systems" card, the Software > OS page, and the software title details page's versions table, instead of sorting only by host count. Versions now sort numerically by segment (so, for example, "26.10" sorts after "26.6") and Windows feature-update codenames (e.g. "22H1") sort by year and half, rather than as plain strings. Added `version` as a valid `order_key` for `GET /api/v1/fleet/os_versions`.
